<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 18:53:25 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>阿里巴巴和腾讯对中国芯片充满信心，因为美国的限制措施可能会减缓他们的人工智能发展</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/tencent-alibaba-us-chip-curbs-cloud-ai/</link><description>腾讯总裁刘炽平称这些限制“不幸”，并承认现在需要更长的时间来训练公司的下一个人工智能模型。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2304616249.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 12:44:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/tencent-alibaba-us-chip-curbs-cloud-ai/</guid></item><item><title>十几岁的时候，她是曼哈顿的一名保姆。现在，她经营着一家年收入 1 亿美元的人工智能初创公司，其客户包括亿万富翁科赫家族</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/22/tribe-ai-cofounder-ceo-jaclyn-rice-nelson-scaling-startup-100-million-revenue-career-success-koch-industries/</link><description>Tribe AI 首席执行官 Jaclyn Rice Nelson 充分利用了建立关系的技巧，成为一家价值 1 亿美元的人工智能初创公司，该公司的收入在一年内几乎翻了两番。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Nelson-TribeAI.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/22/tribe-ai-cofounder-ceo-jaclyn-rice-nelson-scaling-startup-100-million-revenue-career-success-koch-industries/</guid></item><item><title>您应该储备库存以应对停电吗？美国情报局长以新冠病毒为例证明“美国是最令人惊奇和有弹性的地方”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/22/should-you-stock-up-to-prepare-for-outages-director-national-intelligence-jay-clayton-covid-resilience/</link><description>“你如何准备？知道系统将要升级。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2305191998-e1795365457792.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 17:43:35 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/22/should-you-stock-up-to-prepare-for-outages-director-national-intelligence-jay-clayton-covid-resilience/</guid></item><item><title>“时间不匹配”：数据中心电力需求每年增长 19%。电网增长2%</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/22/ai-data-centers-power-grid-capacity/</link><description>保险经纪人豪顿发现，自 2000 年以来，数据中心电力需求的增长速度是电网的 10 倍。选民刚刚收紧了压力，大型科技公司正在转向自己的天然气工厂。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2292181018.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 16:34:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/22/ai-data-centers-power-grid-capacity/</guid></item><item><title>Vertex执行董事长：行业10%到20%的药物试验成功率，我们是如何做到70%以上的</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/22/vertex-leiden-rd-success-rate-fewer-smarter-bets-innovation/</link><description>更多的赌注并不一定会带来更多的成功&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/jeffrey-leiden_6ea868.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 13:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/22/vertex-leiden-rd-success-rate-fewer-smarter-bets-innovation/</guid></item><item><title>对 ChatGPT 刻薄可以提高其准确性，但你的语气可能会对计算成本产生更大的影响</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/being-mean-to-chatgpt-can-boost-its-accuracy-but-your-tone-could-have-an-even-bigger-impact-on-computing-costs/</link><description>同一位研究人员的一项最新研究发现，提示音对 AI 计算成本的影响高达 44.3%。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/GettyImages-1171655728-e1761841855908.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 14:31:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/being-mean-to-chatgpt-can-boost-its-accuracy-but-your-tone-could-have-an-even-bigger-impact-on-computing-costs/</guid></item><item><title>马克·库班 (Mark Cuban) 已经 7 年没有休假，杰夫·贝索斯 (Jeff Bezos) 每天工作 12 小时。商业教练说，这种痴迷是成功的秘诀</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/mark-cuban-no-vacation-jeff-bezos-12-hour-work-days-obsession-secret-to-success-codie-sanchez/</link><description>“痴迷意味着你不停地思考，直到你无情的行动让你无法获胜，”科迪·桑切斯说。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2284594952-e1795209121261.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 14:29:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/mark-cuban-no-vacation-jeff-bezos-12-hour-work-days-obsession-secret-to-success-codie-sanchez/</guid></item><item><title>两年前，沙特阿拉伯悄悄取消了与美国的“石油美元”协议，该协议影响了世界经济 50 年。随后伊朗爆发战争</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/what-was-us-petrodollar-deal-with-saudi-arabia-iran-war-china-petroyuan/</link><description>中国的“石油人民币”体系以前所未有的方式发挥着作用。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/GettyImages-2269559448-e1775590295536.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 14:25:20 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/what-was-us-petrodollar-deal-with-saudi-arabia-iran-war-china-petroyuan/</guid></item><item><title>投资者表示，英伟达的下一任首席执行官必须领导受监管的国际业务——“人工智能平衡的彻底重组”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/22/nvidia-next-ceo-international-business-reorganization-ai-equilibrium/</link><description>英伟达的下一任首席执行官将不得不兼顾投资者关系、出口限制和人工智能基础设施。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2305083085-e1795207841774.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 12:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/22/nvidia-next-ceo-international-business-reorganization-ai-equilibrium/</guid></item><item><title>我是《周六夜现场》的“妹妹”。护理是一种爱的行为，但爱不是护理计划</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/22/snl-sister-elderly-caregiving-expensive/</link><description>我是 A Place For Mom 的首席执行官，我很感谢 SNL 提出这个话题。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2304769592.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 12:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/22/snl-sister-elderly-caregiving-expensive/</guid></item></channel></rss>